<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Good morning,</span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">With reference to your pet booking, we would like to confirm the following details…</span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">Please note it is the responsibility of owners to arrange their own Customs Clearance. </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">For more information regarding this process please refer to your animal transport company or contact customs on 1800 900 090. </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">AWB no. </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">Animals - </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">QF </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">The animal can be collected approx. 90mins after the flight arrival at: </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">Qantas Freight Terminal </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1F497D;
mso-fareast-language:EN-AU;mso-no-proof:yes">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1F497D;
mso-fareast-language:EN-AU;mso-no-proof:yes">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>

