<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1F497D;
mso-fareast-language:EN-AU;mso-no-proof:yes">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">Photo identification is required and there is an import service charge of approx. $100 to pay on collection. </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11px;">After lodgement, you will be able to track the progress of your shipment at<span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU;
mso-no-proof:yes"> </span><a href="http://www.qantasfreight.com.au/"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
color:blue;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU;mso-no-proof:yes">www.qantasfreight.com.au</span></a><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU;mso-no-proof:yes"> </span></span></span></p>

